      *******************************************************************
      * FILE NAME:   PICKBATSP                                          *
      * DESCRIPTION: Pick Batch Scan history (non-unique, K PICKBAT,    *
      *              PICKSEQ).  Used by PICKERR to record each barcode  *
      *              scan against a pick-batch detail line.             *
      *******************************************************************
     A          R PICKBATSR
     A            PICKBAT        8S 0       TEXT('Pick Batch')
     A            PICKSEQ        3S 0       TEXT('Pick Seq')
     A            SCANCODE      30A         TEXT('Scanned Code')
     A            SCANQTY        5S 0       TEXT('Scanned Qty')
     A            SCANTS          Z         TEXT('Scan Timestamp')
     A          K PICKBAT
     A          K PICKSEQ
     A          K SCANCODE
